<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>adjusterGEH - Clinical Decision Support System | Gastroenterology & Hepatology</title>
    
    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    
    <!-- FontAwesome -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    
    <!-- Google Fonts: Inter & Plus Jakarta Sans -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-main: #050B14;
            --glass-bg: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75);
            --glass-bg-hover: rgba(22, 34, 60, 0.88);
            --glass-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);
            --glass-border-hover: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.45);
            --text-heading: #F8FAFC;
            --text-secondary: #94A3B8;
            --text-muted: #64748B;
            --accent-cyan: #00F2FE;
            --accent-blue: #38BDF8;
            --glass-shadow: 0 8px 32px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
            --btn-gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #00F2FE 0%, #2563EB 100%);
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-main);
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            min-height: 100vh;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* Ambient Glow Effects */
        .ambient-glow-1 {
            position: fixed; top: -100px; left: 10%; width: 500px; height: 500px;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.09) 0%, transparent 65%);
            filter: blur(40px); z-index: -1; pointer-events: none;
            transform: translate3d(0,0,0); contain: strict;
        }
        .ambient-glow-2 {
            position: fixed; bottom: 5%; right: 8%; width: 450px; height: 450px;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.08) 0%, transparent 65%);
            filter: blur(40px); z-index: -1; pointer-events: none;
            transform: translate3d(0,0,0); contain: strict;
        }

        /* Custom scrollbar */
        ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 5px; height: 5px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16); border-radius: 4px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3); }

        .glass-panel {
            background: var(--glass-bg);
            backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            box-shadow: var(--glass-shadow);
        }

        .glass-card {
            background: var(--glass-bg);
            backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            box-shadow: var(--glass-shadow);
            transition: all 0.22s ease;
            content-visibility: auto;
            contain-intrinsic-size: 0 450px;
        }
        .glass-card:hover {
            border-color: var(--glass-border-hover);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 30px 0 rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.15);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .glass-input {
            background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.65);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            color: var(--text-heading);
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }
        .glass-input:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: var(--accent-cyan);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.18);
        }

        .glass-btn {
            background: var(--btn-gradient);
            color: #ffffff;
            border: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.35);
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }
        .glass-btn:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.5);
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }

        .glass-btn-secondary {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            color: var(--text-heading);
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }
        .glass-btn-secondary:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
            border-color: var(--accent-cyan);
        }

        /* Quick Module Horizontal Scroll Bar (RheumaTools Style) */
        .quick-nav-bar {
            background: rgba(10, 16, 31, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            position: sticky;
            top: 56px;
            z-index: 30;
            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
        }

        .quick-nav-scroll {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            overflow-x: auto;
            scrollbar-width: none;
            -ms-overflow-style: none;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .quick-nav-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }

        .quick-nav-pill {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            padding: 0.4rem 0.85rem;
            border-radius: 9999px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            white-space: nowrap;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }
        .quick-nav-pill:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);
            color: #ffffff;
            border-color: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.35);
        }
        .quick-nav-pill.active {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.18) 0%, rgba(79, 172, 254, 0.12) 100%);
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            border-color: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.45);
            font-weight: 600;
            box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.2);
        }

        /* Back Navigation Button */
        .btn-back {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            padding: 0.4rem 0.85rem;
            border-radius: 9999px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }
        .btn-back:hover {
            background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.12);
            border-color: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.4);
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            transform: translateX(-2px);
        }

        #toast-notice {
            transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), opacity 0.3s ease;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .ambient-glow-1, .ambient-glow-2 {
                filter: blur(20px) !important;
                width: 300px !important;
                height: 300px !important;
                opacity: 0.5 !important;
                transform: translateZ(0);
            }
            .glass-card {
                backdrop-filter: blur(8px) !important;
                -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px) !important;
                background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.88) !important;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="selection:bg-cyan-900 selection:text-cyan-100">

    <div class="ambient-glow-1"></div>
    <div class="ambient-glow-2"></div>

    <!-- Toast Notification -->
    <div id="toast-notice" class="fixed bottom-6 right-6 z-50 flex items-center space-x-3 px-5 py-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/95 border border-cyan-500/50 shadow-[0_10px_35px_rgba(0,242,254,0.3)] text-white text-sm font-medium translate-y-24 opacity-0 pointer-events-none">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-cyan-400 text-lg"></i>
        <span id="toast-message">Resume klinis berhasil disalin!</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Main App Container -->
    <div class="flex flex-col min-h-screen">
        
        <!-- Top Sticky Header -->
        <header class="h-14 glass-panel sticky top-0 z-40 border-t-0 border-x-0 rounded-none flex items-center justify-between px-3 sm:px-6 gap-2">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 sm:space-x-3 shrink-0">
                <button type="button" onclick="navigateTo('home-module', 'Home Dashboard', 'pill-dash')" class="flex items-center space-x-2 sm:space-x-2.5 cursor-pointer text-left">
                    <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-400/20 to-blue-500/20 border border-cyan-400/40 flex items-center justify-center text-cyan-400 shrink-0">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-staff-snake text-base"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <span class="text-white font-bold text-sm tracking-tight block leading-tight font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans']">adjusterGEH</span>
                        <span class="text-[10px] text-cyan-400 font-medium block leading-tight">Clinical CDSS</span>
                    </div>
                </button>
                <div class="h-4 w-px bg-white/10 hidden md:block"></div>
                <div class="hidden md:block">
                    <h2 id="header-title" class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-200 truncate max-w-[140px] lg:max-w-none">Home Dashboard</h2>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Top Search Bar (Realtime Calculator Discovery) -->
            <div class="relative flex-1 max-w-xs sm:max-w-md mx-1 sm:mx-4" id="header-search-container">
                <div class="relative flex items-center">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass absolute left-3 text-slate-400 text-xs pointer-events-none"></i>
                    <input type="text" id="global-search-input" placeholder="Cari kalkulator (e.g. Rome IV, Lyon, ESPEN, MELD)..." autocomplete="off" class="w-full pl-8 pr-14 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-700/70 text-xs text-white placeholder-slate-400 focus:outline-none focus:border-cyan-400 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-cyan-400 transition-all">
                    <span class="hidden sm:inline-block absolute right-2.5 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] font-mono text-slate-400 bg-slate-800 rounded border border-slate-700 pointer-events-none">Ctrl K</span>
                    <button id="search-clear-btn" type="button" onclick="clearGlobalSearch()" class="hidden absolute right-2.5 text-slate-400 hover:text-white text-xs px-1">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i>
                    </button>
                </div>
                <!-- Search Results Dropdown -->
                <div id="search-results-dropdown" class="hidden absolute top-full left-0 right-0 mt-2 bg-slate-900/95 backdrop-blur-xl border border-cyan-500/30 rounded-xl shadow-[0_12px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.85)] z-50 max-h-96 overflow-y-auto p-2"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 shrink-0">
                <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-300 border border-cyan-500/30 font-medium">31 Tools</span>
            </div>
        </header>

        <!-- Sticky Quick Navigation Bar (Horizontal Scrollable Pills) -->
        <nav class="quick-nav-bar" aria-label="Quick Category Switcher">
            <div class="quick-nav-scroll">
                <button type="button" id="pill-dash" onclick="navigateTo('home-module', 'Home Dashboard', this.id)" class="quick-nav-pill active">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-house text-cyan-400 text-xs"></i>
                    <span>Dashboard</span>
                </button>
                <button type="button" id="pill-bleed" onclick="navigateTo('hub-bleed', 'GI Bleed Hub', this.id)" class="quick-nav-pill">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-droplet text-rose-400 text-xs"></i>
                    <span>GI Bleeding</span>
                </button>
                <button type="button" id="pill-hepa" onclick="navigateTo('hub-hepa', 'Hepatology Hub', this.id)" class="quick-nav-pill">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-flask text-amber-400 text-xs"></i>
                    <span>Hepatology</span>
                </button>
                <button type="button" id="pill-pancreato" onclick="navigateTo('hub-pancreato', 'Pancreatobiliary Hub', this.id)" class="quick-nav-pill">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-bacteria text-emerald-400 text-xs"></i>
                    <span>Pancreatobiliary</span>
                </button>
                <button type="button" id="pill-ibd" onclick="navigateTo('hub-ibd', 'Luminal & IBD Hub', this.id)" class="quick-nav-pill">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-disease text-purple-400 text-xs"></i>
                    <span>Luminal & IBD</span>
                </button>
                <button type="button" id="pill-functional" onclick="navigateTo('hub-functional', 'Functional GI Hub', this.id)" class="quick-nav-pill">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-arrows-split-up-and-left text-pink-400 text-xs"></i>
                    <span>Functional GI</span>
                </button>
                <button type="button" id="pill-endo" onclick="navigateTo('hub-endo', 'Endoscopy Hub', this.id)" class="quick-nav-pill">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-microscope text-teal-400 text-xs"></i>
                    <span>Endoscopy</span>
                </button>
            </div>
        </nav>

        <!-- Main Content View -->
        <main class="flex-1 p-4 sm:p-6 lg:p-8 w-full max-w-6xl mx-auto z-10">

            <!-- ======================================================== -->
            <!-- LEVEL 0: HOME DASHBOARD                                  -->
            <!-- ======================================================== -->
            <section id="home-module" class="module-section block">
                
                <!-- Welcome Banner -->
                <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-7 mb-7 relative overflow-hidden border-t-2 border-t-cyan-400/50">
                    <div class="absolute -right-6 -top-6 opacity-10 pointer-events-none">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-notes-medical text-9xl text-cyan-400"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="relative z-10">
                        <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-cyan-500/20 text-cyan-300 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full border border-cyan-500/30 inline-block mb-2">
                            Evidence-Based Medicine
                        </span>
                        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-white font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans']">
                            adjusterGEH <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 to-sky-400">Toolkit</span>
                        </h2>
                        <p class="text-slate-300 max-w-3xl text-xs sm:text-sm mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                            Sistem pendukung keputusan klinis gastroenterologi & hepatologi berbasis bukti: skor risiko, kriteria diagnostik Rome IV & Lyon Consensus 2.0, nutrisi sirosis ESPEN, dan algoritma tatalaksana ACG, EASL, AGA, BSG, dan USMSTF.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 6 Main Category Cards Grid (Level 0 -> Level 1 Hub) -->
                <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-3 flex items-center justify-between">
                    <span>Kategori Modul Klinis</span>
                    <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-normal">Klik kategori untuk membuka pilihan modul</span>
                </h3>
                
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
                    
                    <!-- 1. GI Bleed -->
                    <button type="button" onclick="navigateTo('hub-bleed', 'GI Bleeding Hub', 'pill-bleed')" class="glass-card rounded-xl p-5 flex flex-col items-start text-left cursor-pointer group w-full">
                        <div class="h-11 w-11 rounded-lg bg-rose-500/10 text-rose-400 border border-rose-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-3 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-droplet"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-white text-base mb-1 group-hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors">1. Hemorrhagic & GI Bleed</h4>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 line-clamp-2 mb-3">GBS (UGIB), Oakland (LGIB), Rockall (Pre & Post-Endoscopy), AIMS65, Antithrombotic, & Forrest Classification.</p>
                        <span class="mt-auto text-xs text-rose-400 font-semibold flex items-center">Buka 6 Kalkulator <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right ml-1.5 text-[10px]"></i></span>
                    </button>

                    <!-- 2. Hepatology -->
                    <button type="button" onclick="navigateTo('hub-hepa', 'Hepatology Hub', 'pill-hepa')" class="glass-card rounded-xl p-5 flex flex-col items-start text-left cursor-pointer group w-full">
                        <div class="h-11 w-11 rounded-lg bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400 border border-amber-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-3 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-flask"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-white text-base mb-1 group-hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors">2. Hepatology & Cirrhosis</h4>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 line-clamp-2 mb-3">Child-Pugh, MELD Trio, ESPEN Nutrition, SAAG & PMN, FIB-4 & APRI, R-Factor, De Ritis, NFS, Maddrey, CLIF-C, Baveno VII, & Panel LFT RS.</p>
                        <span class="mt-auto text-xs text-amber-400 font-semibold flex items-center">Buka 12 Kalkulator <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right ml-1.5 text-[10px]"></i></span>
                    </button>

                    <!-- 3. Pancreatobiliary -->
                    <button type="button" onclick="navigateTo('hub-pancreato', 'Pancreatobiliary Hub', 'pill-pancreato')" class="glass-card rounded-xl p-5 flex flex-col items-start text-left cursor-pointer group w-full">
                        <div class="h-11 w-11 rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-3 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-bacteria"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-white text-base mb-1 group-hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors">3. Pancreatobiliary & Inf</h4>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 line-clamp-2 mb-3">BISAP Score, Ranson's Criteria (0 & 48 Jam), TG18 (Cholecystitis/Cholangitis), Revised Atlanta 2012, & ACG C. diff.</p>
                        <span class="mt-auto text-xs text-emerald-400 font-semibold flex items-center">Buka 5 Kalkulator <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right ml-1.5 text-[10px]"></i></span>
                    </button>

                    <!-- 4. Luminal & IBD -->
                    <button type="button" onclick="navigateTo('hub-ibd', 'Luminal & IBD Hub', 'pill-ibd')" class="glass-card rounded-xl p-5 flex flex-col items-start text-left cursor-pointer group w-full">
                        <div class="h-11 w-11 rounded-lg bg-purple-500/10 text-purple-400 border border-purple-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-3 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-disease"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-white text-base mb-1 group-hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors">4. Luminal & IBD</h4>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 line-clamp-2 mb-3">Truelove & Witts (UC Disease Severity), Mayo Score for UC, Harvey-Bradshaw Index (Crohn's), & Fecal Calprotectin.</p>
                        <span class="mt-auto text-xs text-purple-400 font-semibold flex items-center">Buka 4 Kalkulator <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right ml-1.5 text-[10px]"></i></span>
                    </button>

                    <!-- 5. Functional GI -->
                    <button type="button" onclick="navigateTo('hub-functional', 'Functional GI Hub', 'pill-functional')" class="glass-card rounded-xl p-5 flex flex-col items-start text-left cursor-pointer group w-full border-pink-500/30">
                        <div class="h-11 w-11 rounded-lg bg-pink-500/10 text-pink-400 border border-pink-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-3 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-arrows-split-up-and-left"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-white text-base mb-1 group-hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors">5. Functional GI & Motility</h4>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 line-clamp-2 mb-3">Rome IV Criteria (IBS & Subtipe), Rome IV (Dispepsia Fungsional PDS vs EPS), Lyon Consensus 2.0 (Objektif GERD), & LA Class.</p>
                        <span class="mt-auto text-xs text-pink-400 font-semibold flex items-center">Buka 4 Kalkulator <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right ml-1.5 text-[10px]"></i></span>
                    </button>

                    <!-- 6. Endoscopy -->
                    <button type="button" onclick="navigateTo('hub-endo', 'Endoscopy Hub', 'pill-endo')" class="glass-card rounded-xl p-5 flex flex-col items-start text-left cursor-pointer group w-full">
                        <div class="h-11 w-11 rounded-lg bg-teal-500/10 text-teal-400 border border-teal-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-3 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-microscope"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-white text-base mb-1 group-hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors">6. Endoscopy & Surveillance</h4>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 line-clamp-2 mb-3">Post-Polypectomy surveillance interval guidelines berdasarkan rekomendasi USMSTF 2020.</p>
                        <span class="mt-auto text-xs text-teal-400 font-semibold flex items-center">Buka Kalkulator <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right ml-1.5 text-[10px]"></i></span>
                    </button>

                </div>

                <!-- Medical Disclaimer -->
                <div class="mt-8 glass-panel p-4 rounded-xl flex items-start border-l-4 border-l-amber-500 bg-slate-900/60">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation text-amber-400 mt-1 mr-3 text-base"></i>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                        <strong class="text-white font-semibold">Medical Disclaimer:</strong> adjusterGEH CDSS ditujukan untuk dokter, gastroenterolog, dan tenaga medis sebagai alat bantu klinis dan referensi berbasis bukti. Seluruh rekomendasi harus selalu disesuaikan dengan penilaian klinis komprehensif (*clinical judgment*) terhadap kondisi masing-masing pasien.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- ======================================================== -->
            <!-- LEVEL 1: CATEGORY HUBS                                   -->
            <!-- ======================================================== -->

            <!-- Hub 1: GI Bleeding -->
            <section id="hub-bleed" class="module-section hidden">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-5">
                    <button type="button" onclick="navigateTo('home-module', 'Home Dashboard', 'pill-dash')" class="btn-back">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i> Kembali ke Dashboard
                    </button>
                    <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold rounded-full bg-rose-500/20 text-rose-300 border border-rose-500/30">6 Modul</span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2 font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans']">Hemorrhagic & GI Bleed Tools</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-5">Pilih instrumen kalkulator perdarahan saluran cerna di bawah ini:</p>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
                    <button type="button" onclick="navigateTo('gbs-module', 'Glasgow-Blatchford Score', 'pill-bleed', 'hub-bleed')" class="glass-card rounded-xl p-5 flex items-start text-left cursor-pointer group">
                        <div class="h-10 w-10 rounded-lg bg-rose-500/10 text-rose-400 border border-rose-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-lg mr-4 shrink-0 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-dots"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-white text-sm mb-1 group-hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors">Glasgow-Blatchford Score (GBS)</h4>
                            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Stratifikasi risiko UGIB sebelum endoskopi untuk menentukan kelayakan rawat jalan.</p>
                        </div>
                    </button>

